    "title": "BlitzWolf ANC1 Wireless bluetooth Earphone In Ear Earbuds Headset Active Noise Cancellation Hi-Fi Stereo Earphones Mic For Phone",
    "body_html": "<div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\">Clearance Sale! SHIPPING within 24 hours and delivery in 4-7 days</span></strong></p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0<br></p>\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Features:</p>\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">1. Active noise-cancelling: Reduce background sounds by up to 20dB with our advanced noisecancelling technology. Listen to your favorite music at work, the gym, on the plane, or while relaxing at home. 2. Bluetooth 4.1: The BW-ANC1 can connect to two devices simultaneously and will automatically reconnect to any previously paired device. 3. Apt-X: High-quality AptX codec produces high fidelity stereo sound output. 4. 7 Hours of Continuous Audio: Enhanced and boosted with a 120mAh battery, enjoy 7 hours of pure continuous music playback or voice chat. 5. IPX4 Splash-proof: Our sweat-proof design allows you to enjoy your music as you exercise. 6. Clothes Clip: This elegant design avoids you from getting entangled with the wire during outdoor activities, such as hiking, cycling, sports and other exercises.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Specifications:</p>\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Brand BlitzWolf\u00ae Model BW-ANC1 Color Black Wearing Type In-ear Dimensions Line length: 50cm ANC: 2.6*2.6*14cm Technical Parameters Microphone Yes Wired Control Support Bluetooth Version V4.1 Transmission Distance 10m Noise reduction range(200-800Hz) -20\u00b15dB S/N 80dB Sensitivity 105dB Impedance 32\u03a9 Frequency Response 20-20kHz Battery Capacity 120mAh, 3.7V Charging Time 2h Talking Time 6h Working Time 7h Standby Time 240h</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_text\">\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-title\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 900; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Package Included:</p>\n<p class=\"detail-desc-decorate-content\" style=\"text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: 'OpenSans'; color: #000; word-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: 300; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">1* BlitzWolf\u00ae BW-ANC1 Active Noise Cancelling Wireless Bluetooth Earphone 1* USB Charging Cable 1* EVA Storage Box 3 pairs of eartips 1* Cable Clip 1* Manual</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_text-image\">\n<img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H32f7e1eb61ac48228ec02fa54557c07fF.jpg\" alt=\"Blitzwolf anc1 wireless bluetooth earphone in ear earbuds headset active noise cancellation hi-fi stereo earphones mic for phone\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H88570c6e593c47af8a9f1bfd1f8854acd.jpg\" alt=\"Blitzwolf anc1 wireless bluetooth earphone in ear earbuds headset active noise cancellation hi-fi stereo earphones mic for phone\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"detail-desc-decorate-image\" src=\"//ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hae6575bbda664024be2e538cba7eb0faD.jpg\" alt=\"Blitzwolf anc1 wireless bluetooth earphone in ear earbuds headset active noise cancellation hi-fi stereo earphon